      "writtenOn": "2022-08-02T20:06:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "gatekeeperd is part of the Android system, so this would be interpreting the format across the HAL implementation if it does inspect this format. Does it? What is the format? Is it the same on all devices?",
      "parentUuid": "e75700d9_bc24a119",
