      "writtenOn": "2022-08-02T21:28:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "gatekeeperd expects this format to be either in password_handle_t or hw_token_t based on the api.\n1. In the Enroll case, it is password_handle_t. ( https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:system/gatekeeper/include/gatekeeper/password_handle.h;drc\u003dd959f926cfb5776684a809b3da0fd6bec5f57337;l\u003d33)\n2. In the Verify case, it is  hw_token_t. (https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:hardware/libhardware/include/hardware/hw_auth_token.h;drc\u003dd959f926cfb5776684a809b3da0fd6bec5f57337;l\u003d47 )\nas the gatekeeperd expects in the above two formats. It should be the same on all devices.",
      "parentUuid": "4ba06647_a520f006",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 36,
        "startChar": 29,
        "endLine": 36,
        "endChar": 54
      },
      "revId": "6387e5eded52350330030da8af3931a5b0beff21",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
